4. Technology Stack & Infrastructure Blueprint
Frontend: Vite + Tailwind CSS (hosted on Cloudflare Pages with zero-cost global edge caching).

Backend Gateway: FastAPI (Python 3.11+, asynchronous routing, native WebSockets).

Message Broker & Queue: RabbitMQ (robust enterprise broker) + Celery (worker task management with exponential backoff and DLQ).

State & Caching: Redis (session store, pub/sub notification layer).

ML Core & MLOps:

PyTorch & Torchaudio / Librosa for audio processing, embedding generation, and custom lightweight model training.

MLflow for experiment tracking and model artifact registry.

Pytest for rigorous unit testing (API routes, WebSocket validation, tensor shapes).

GitHub Actions for CI/CD automation (linting, tests, automated container builds).

Production Deployment: A budget-friendly Linux VPS (DigitalOcean / Hetzner / Zeabur ~₹350–₹450/mo) running Docker Compose. (Local K3s/Minikube configuration included for Kubernetes practice).

